Package: dilock
Title: Experimental Distributed Lock Client for Redis, etcd, and Consul
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Dilock", "Contributors", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "maintainers@example.invalid")
Author: Dilock Contributors [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Dilock Contributors <maintainers@example.invalid>
Description: Experimental distributed-lock adapters for Redis, native etcd gRPC, and Consul HTTP KV sessions. These adapters are not production-supported.
